            "title": "Placing Your ORder"
          }
        },
        "49307083-141b-41cb-90ed-6fdd4db5913b": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use multiple discount codes at one time?",
            "answer": "<p>The usage of multiple discount codes at one time is prohibited.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ee37c0f8-236e-4f52-a030-7c33ed2210be": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use discount codes on sale products?",
            "answer": "<p>Discount code usage on sale products is allowed given the specific promotion highlights this.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d2b80702-2484-4104-b69c-d8e1379d1c2d": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I have a discount code, where do I enter this?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Mobile: </strong>The option to use a discount code becomes available on the <strong>'Payment' page</strong> before entering your payment details.<br/><br/><strong>Desktop: </strong>The option to use a discount code is available on the right hand column of the checkout page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f0a679c7-5d4b-4b8a-aaf2-7620753a5531": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get notified of a product restocking?",
            "answer": "<p>Simply head to the product page and enter your email address or mobile number into the prompted box. Once we restock, an email/SMS will notify you immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ca2d7c1a-237a-4bce-b8f6-94f998cab622": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does your Pre Order option work?",
            "answer": "<p>Cut the que, Pre Order and reserve some our best-selling designs. When you Pre Order, full payment is taken upfront to reserve your order. When your order arrives in stock, we'll ship this to you in the fastest possible manner with full updates from our delivery team. Cancel anytime. 100% refund guaranteed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "4e27adfd-764a-4150-83a1-4653584121e8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "answer": "<p>We accept various forms of payment which include the following. Apple<br/>Pay, Visa, Visa Debit, Mastercard, PayPal, Klarna, Shop Pay, American<br/>Express & Google Pay.</p>"
          }
        },
        "22bab43f-e97b-48fe-bd9b-74b589b6a090": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do your E-GIFT cards work?",
            "answer": "<p>E-Gift Cards are delivered to you via email and contain instructions on<br/>how to redeem them at checkout. Our E-Gift Cards have no additional processing<br/>fees and no expiry date.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cffff0dd-dc0e-411b-bfe1-a120f5c7ad3b": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you physically stock products?",
            "answer": "<p>We physically stocks 1000’s of products in our Cheshire East based<br/>warehouse, all ready to be shipped immediately. If a product is available on Pre Order, this simply means that it’s on it's way to our warehouse ready to ship as soon as it lands with us.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d721bd0e-60fc-4af5-8845-08366461e6eb": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "DELIVERY"
          }
        },
        "7c5fe839-6e99-43c5-b659-43baa938071c": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much do you charge for delivery?",
            "answer": "<p>Delivery to Mainland UK is <strong>FREE.</strong><br/><br/>Delivery to Northern Ireland is available at a fixed fee of £30.00.</p>"
          }
        },
        "669486fa-650c-4bab-ac0c-19878d56d555": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you ship overseas?",
            "answer": "<p>We currently only ship to Mainland UK & Northern Ireland. Our team are looking at solutions for international delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "94ebdd2d-764a-4103-9330-ee3b61f9d03d": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I change my shipping address after I've ordered?",
            "answer": "<p>Please update us of any address changes within <strong>24 hours</strong> of<br/>your order being placed. Any address changes after this period may result in a delay in your order being shipped.</p>"
          }
        },
        "977753b3-f173-447a-ac0c-3928d5575d99": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is shipping?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>In stock:</strong> William Wood Dedicated Delivery will deliver your order within up to <strong>2-7<br/>working days</strong> from the date of your order being placed. <br/><br/><strong>Pre Order:</strong> If you have placed an order for a product which is available on Pre Order, please check the advised shipment week which is available to view on the product page. Once your Pre Order lands in stock, this will be delivered to you within the advised week.</p>"
          }
        },
        "896e1a1b-f795-4573-a8f3-9e389f2518c1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I track my order?",
            "answer": "<p>At this stage we’re unable to offer tracking. However, William Wood<br/>Dedicated Delivery is proud to offer one of the most transparent delivery<br/>services in our industry. All of our in-house drivers are fully accustomed with<br/>the difficulties of home delivery when it comes to furniture, with that in mind<br/>you can be certain that our driver will be in contact with you at least 24<br/>hours prior to delivery. We also provide our drivers direct contact number, so<br/>if you wish to contact them in regards to your delivery please feel free to do<br/>so.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a2a7589f-f7bd-4dae-93f2-d0fb4841944e": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "title": "EXCHANGES/RETURNS & REFUNDS "
          }
        },
        "917d783b-c8d1-4e27-b670-b05d40e751d6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What happens if I want to exchange my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Should you wish to exchange your order, this service is <strong>FREE</strong> within<br/>up to <strong>90 days</strong> of your order being received. Should the product<br/>you wish to exchange to be higher in price than the initial product on your<br/>order, the difference in price will be processed by our Customer Support<br/>Team. Should the product you wish to exchange to be lower in price than<br/>the initial product on your order, an exchange will be carried out. Once the<br/>initial product is returned back to our warehouse, the difference in price will<br/>be refunded back to you as soon as possible. Please note your fist exchange<br/>is <strong>Free</strong>. Any additional exchanges which are not a result of faulty<br/>product are charged at a fixed fee of <strong>£15.00.</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "69b244eb-8c42-47b7-9408-345d94e4efe0": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What happens if I want to return my order?",
            "answer": "<p>No problem, simply contact sales@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk within <strong>90<br/>days</strong> of receiving your order and we’ll do the rest. Please note that<br/>we offer a Free Returns service, however please refer to our <strong>Returns<br/>& Exchanges</strong> page at the bottom of our web-store for more<br/>information on this.</p>"
          }
        },
        "65cff28d-aa88-4ef2-a04e-c3a0791940cb": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel my Order/Pre Order?",
            "answer": "<p>Of course, you retain full control of your order with us at all times.<br/>Simply contact sales@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk as soon as possible and our<br/>Customer Support Team will be happy to assist. If you wish to cancel your order<br/>whilst out for delivery, we can only refund you once the product has been<br/>physically received back at our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "02ccfd3b-6320-4ce8-88d3-6c62bbe44bb9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will it take to receive my refund?",
            "answer": "<p>We're leading the way in our industry and believe our customers should<br/>not have to wait to receive their money back. Therefore, rest assured your<br/>order will be refunded as soon as it arrives back to our<br/>warehouse.  Please note it can up to 1-3 business days for your<br/>refund to show in your account.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d823a3f7-7176-4899-9d8a-3758a1800d24": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can’t find the answer you’re looking for?",
            "answer": "<p>Email sales@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk and our Customer Support Team<br/>will be more than happy to assist.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
